    Values that identify the cluster this bundle installs into. Nothing reads
    them for connection — the provider comes from the caller. They exist so
    each release is contained by the cluster: replace the cluster and every
    release is replaced with it, rather than being adopted by a cluster that
    has never seen it.

    Pass attributes of the cluster resource that change when it is rebuilt:
